        "answer": {
          "short": "$r^{3y + 1}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\nr^{2y + 3} \\times r^{y - 2} &= r^{2 \\times y + 3 + y - 2} \\\\\n&= r^{3y + 1}\n\\end{align*}$$",
